  "rules-states-fr": {
   "x": 7640,
   "y": 0,
   "text": "State rules. Loading: skeletons after 300 ms, never a spinner over content; after 10 s, offer a retry. Empty: say what will appear here and give one next step. Errors: say what happened, whether anything was lost or charged, and one way forward; a small reference code for support, never a raw error. Offline: a banner on every screen; tracking, crisis numbers and the safety plan keep working; booking, payment and calls are disabled with the reason. Permissions: explain before the phone asks, and how to fix it after a refusal.",
