  },
  "staff-sticky": {
   "x": 1520,
   "y": 1380,
   "w": 340,
   "fill": "blue",
   "page": "states",
   "text": "Staff accounts. A Super admin adds each staff member; Solace generates a unique temporary password to hand over in person. It works once and expires after 72 hours. First sign-in forces a new password and an authenticator app. Built on Keycloak required actions (update password, configure OTP); nobody signs themselves up."
  },
